--- task
id: t21
dataset: section8
kind: union of two reads

--- intent
List the names of all people and all companies in one result, with a column `kind` that says "person" or "company".

--- edition3
query people_and_companies() {
  match {
    from union(
      { match { $p: Person } return { $p.name as name, "person" as kind } },
      { match { $c: Company } return { $c.name as name, "company" as kind } })
  }
  return { $name, $kind }
}
